        "question": "How do I register with Makeberry?",
        "answer": "Click the \"Login\" button in the header of this page to begin the sign-up process for your affiliate account. Once you have reached the new page, click «Affiliate Sign Up» and fill in all the information required for registration. After submitting, you’ll receive a verification code to complete your registration. Once registered, your account status will be marked as \"pending.\" A manager will review your information and reach out to you soon for confirmation."
