        "id": "prohibited-traffic",
        "question": "What types of traffic are prohibited by Makeberry?",
        "answer": "Spam, fraudulent traffic, deceptive or misleading advertisement (false promises or clickbait), using someone else's content. Some types of traffic may be prohibited within the framework of a particular deal."
      },
      {
        "id": "fraud-grounds",
        "question": "On what grounds can traffic be considered fraudulent?",
        "answer": "Traffic can be considered fraudulent based on different indicators, such as fake accounts, inconsistent user behavior (rapid clicks, extremely high CTRs, and short session durations can suggest automated activity), suspicious patterns, like multiple conversions from the same IP or device. Using deceptive ads, hidden content, or unapproved traffic sources can lead to fraudulent traffic labels."
      },
      {
        "id": "earnings",
        "question": "How much can affiliates earn with Makeberry?",
        "answer": "It depends on the specific deal. Within the revshare model, your profit is absolutely unlimited, since you receive a commission from the revenue. Accordingly, the more interested players you bring to the brand, the higher your profit will be. As for the CPA, we offer a wide range of offers and the rate may vary depending on geo, brand, traffic source, and so on. For example, within one of the offers our partners receive €400/ftd in Canada for WinSpirit Casino. Check the list of the offers in our dashboard or contact your manager to find the most suitable deal for you."
      }
